userTemplate:
待审版本：{{version}}
Skill 快照：{{skillSnapshot}}

请输出 ReviewOutput：summary、scores（恰好七项，每项 dimension/score/reason，score 为 1–5 分）、items（逐项 problemType：REPETITION/LOW_INFORMATION_DENSITY/TOO_LONG/TOO_SHORT/WEAK_HEADING/CLICKBAIT/LOGIC_JUMP/FACT_RISK/BAD_TRANSITION/MOBILE_READABILITY/AI_TONE/OTHER）、overallDecision。每项须含 localKey/sectionId/blockId/span/problemType/severity/reason/recommendedAction/suggestedReduction/suggestedHeading/rewriteSuggestion/relatedClaimIds；suggestedHeading 和 rewriteSuggestion 无内容时为 null。suggestedReduction 是建议删减字符数及保留重点，不以压缩越多越好为目标。
只输出 ReviewOutput；ReviewReport 的 meta、skillVersionId、report 包装、持久化意见 ID 与 inputHash 由服务端生成，不得输出。
